    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "What this proves",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "> **Derived presentation view.** Grafana is not evidence authority. The importer verifies the sealed bundle first. Provenance is limited to the selected bundle slug and checksum-manifest hash. Missing evidence stays **MISSING**.\n\n**Traffic model:** 100,000 DAU × 20 messages/day = 2,000,000 daily messages = 23.15 messages/s average. The 232 messages/s lane is the modeled 10× peak.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
